.TH tuxml n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tuxml \- Small XML text helper in pure Tcl 8.6+.
.SH EXAMPLE
.PP
.nf
package require tclutils::tuxml

puts [::tclutils::tuxml::declaration]
puts [::tclutils::tuxml::textElement title {} {A < B & C}]
.fi
.SH NOTES
.PP
Use \fBtextElement\fR when content is plain text. Use \fBelement\fR only when the
.PP
content is already XML markup.

